            { t: "Had it draft / summarize / translate", s: 3 },
            { t: "Set up AI to handle part of a recurring task", s: 4 },
            { t: "Built a tool or service with AI", s: 5 },
            { t: "Ran a system where AI works on its own", s: 6 },
          ],
        },
        {
          q: "When you hand work to AI, which is closest to your relationship with it?",
          opts: [
            { t: "Nothing to hand off / I don't", s: 1 },
            { t: "I ask when I get stuck", s: 2 },
            { t: "I toss one-off tasks and use the result", s: 3 },
            { t: "I've handed off part of my workflow entirely", s: 4 },
            { t: "I design what AI does, in code / tools", s: 5 },
            { t: "I've set up AIs to pass work to each other", s: 6 },
          ],
        },
        {
          q: 'When you wonder "can I let AI handle this?", you…',
          opts: [
            { t: "Never thought about it", s: 1 },
            { t: "Just eyeball whether the answer's right", s: 2 },
            { t: "Take the output and edit it myself", s: 3 },
            { t: "Create zones I delegate without checking, and trust them", s: 4 },
            { t: "Decompose my part vs AI's part and systematize", s: 5 },
            { t: "Even cross-delegate the checking to another AI", s: 6 },
          ],
        },
        {
          q: 'Your experience "building" something with AI?',
          opts: [
